# Multicheck AI provider configuration (example — no secrets)
#
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, or set as Vercel Environment Variables for prod.
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY. These are NEVER exposed to the browser bundle.
#
# AI_PROVIDER   nous | openrouter | zai | generic   (default: nous)
# AI_MODEL      provider model id. Nous default: z-ai/glm-5.3 (paid, needs credits)
#               free dev alt: tencent/hy3:free
# AI_BASE_URL   optional override (default per provider)
# AI_API_KEY    SERVER-ONLY secret. Vercel: dedicated Nous Portal key in dashboard.
#               Never reuse personal ~/.hermes/auth.json or OAuth tokens.
# AI_TIMEOUT_MS request timeout ms (default 20000)
# AI_TAGS       comma list, nous requires: hermes-agent
